WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.880
Most new real estate agents burn out
chasing one-off transactions. It's an

00:04.880 --> 00:10.340
exhausting cycle of scattered effort and
zero predictability. But you can turn that

00:10.340 --> 00:14.820
chaotic hustle into a consistent,
relationship-based business using this

00:14.820 --> 00:18.840
interactive blueprint. It starts by
treating your career like an actual

00:18.840 --> 00:23.520
business. Set your target income, and the
guide's calculator works backward to tell

00:23.520 --> 00:28.600
you the exact, controllable daily actions
you need to hit it. Those daily actions

00:28.600 --> 00:34.440
feed the core client loop. Find. Nurture.
Keep. Nurturing means providing useful

00:34.440 --> 00:38.500
support long before they buy, earning the
trust that guarantees repeat business

00:38.500 --> 00:43.040
later. To manage those relationships,
you'll organize your network in a simple

00:43.040 --> 00:47.700
contact database. The system forces you to
assign every single lead a clear next

00:47.700 --> 00:51.820
step, so absolutely no one falls through
the cracks. And if that sounds

00:51.820 --> 00:56.380
overwhelming, you start small. The
interactive scripts, daily exercises, and

00:56.380 --> 01:01.620
structured 90-day plan help you lock these
habits into a sustainable routine. By

01:01.620 --> 01:06.160
replacing scattered effort with targeted
daily habits, you transform unpredictable

01:06.160 --> 01:09.800
sales into a steady, growing pipeline of
lifelong clients.

